    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Julio (A)} at (F-10) (Northwest of Conflux #02).
* He will ask for 3 {@i:Purple Polypore|5682} {i:Purple Polypores|Purple Polypore|5682}.
** Purple Polypores drop off of {m:Shadow Funguars|Shadow Funguar} to the northeast, around (G-8)/(H-8), next to Conflux #04.
** The drop rate is fairly low, so a Thief with {p:Treasure Hunter} is recommended.
* Trade him three Purple Polypores to complete the quest and receive two {i:Soothing Potions|Soothing Potion|5716}.
** The followup quest, {q:The Walking Wounded|The Walking Wounded|The Walking Wounded}, requires 5 {i:Soothing Potions|Soothing Potion|5716}. However, you can't start that quest until fame level 4.
** It is advised to stockpile your potions until you are able to start that quest, since this pair of quests is the easiest way to max fame in {z:Abyssea - Konschtat}.
** 30 completions of this quest and 12 completions of the following quest (using the 60 accumulated Potions from this quest) will max out zone fame.

__Zoning **is not** required to repeat this quest.__
